# 1. CREATE PROJECT

Open terminal:

```bash
npm create vite@latest ai-creator-dashboard -- --template react
```

Then:

```bash
cd ai-creator-dashboard
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Install Tailwind:

```bash
npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
```

Init Tailwind:

```bash
npx tailwindcss init -p
```

Install extra packages:

```bash
npm install framer-motion lucide-react
```

---

